WEBVTT

00:00:17.058 --> 00:00:18.935
The controls aren't working!

00:00:18.935 --> 00:00:20.979
We're drifting farther and farther away!

00:00:22.814 --> 00:00:25.316
The gap between dimensions...

00:00:25.316 --> 00:00:30.030
The howl of distorted space...
The dissonance of despair...

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:38.705
Unless we do something,
soon we, too, are going to...

00:00:40.331 --> 00:00:41.833
Shrade?!

00:00:42.959 --> 00:00:44.210
Let's merge again!

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:46.338
You can't merge in your condition!

00:00:51.343 --> 00:00:57.098
If we merge, I'll be able to read the
musical scale of the dimensional flow.

00:00:57.098 --> 00:00:59.225
Shrade...

00:00:59.225 --> 00:01:03.855
Don't fight the flow!
Harmonize with the sounds surrounding us!

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:14.240
Are you feeling this, my good friend?

00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:16.701
This is my last Gattai.

00:01:17.786 --> 00:01:22.457
Koukyou Gattai! Go! Aquarion!

00:01:34.135 --> 00:01:35.929
"Melody of Myth"

00:01:35.929 --> 00:01:38.223
"Melody of Myth"
Looks like everyone's here.

00:01:38.223 --> 00:01:41.059
We have something important to tell you.

00:01:44.729 --> 00:01:49.025
What we are about to tell you
is an eternal myth passed down

00:01:49.025 --> 00:01:54.406
from ten thousand years and two thousand
more ago, and another ten thousand years

00:01:54.406 --> 00:01:56.825
and two thousand more before that.

00:01:56.825 --> 00:02:00.412
How absurd! If we have time for fairy tales,

00:02:00.412 --> 00:02:02.914
we should go help Amata and the others ASAP!

00:02:09.879 --> 00:02:11.756
What's this?

00:02:11.756 --> 00:02:13.174
What the hell is this?!

00:02:13.174 --> 00:02:16.344
What?! What?! Whaaat?!

00:02:17.762 --> 00:02:19.848
We're on a book?

00:02:19.848 --> 00:02:23.101
This book has been with you all this time.

00:02:24.102 --> 00:02:29.190
This is an immovable book that even the
passing of many ages cannot sweep away.

00:02:29.190 --> 00:02:31.943
It's called the Book of the Twin Stars.

00:02:33.028 --> 00:02:34.821
And now...

00:02:37.198 --> 00:02:38.742
...it's open!

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:52.047
The time was twenty thousand years
and four thousand more ago.

00:02:59.262 --> 00:03:03.600
This image... It's clearer
than my Despair Prediction.

00:03:22.660 --> 00:03:25.830
This sword is a tuning fork...

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:28.625
A compass that points to the light at the exit.

00:03:35.215 --> 00:03:37.175
What's this? A mirage?

00:03:37.175 --> 00:03:39.219
The tuning fork is awakening

00:03:39.219 --> 00:03:43.473
the memories that were engraved
in this gap in space-time.

00:03:45.141 --> 00:03:47.560
--Shrade!
--Shrade!

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:49.562
Just focus on what's in front of you!

00:03:59.531 --> 00:04:03.076
The Shadow Angels, who were
mankind's natural enemy...

00:04:04.953 --> 00:04:09.416
Countless defeats and countless deaths...

00:04:09.416 --> 00:04:12.168
The footsteps of the destruction
creeping up on mankind...

00:04:13.628 --> 00:04:18.174
Yes, the Massacring Angel Apollonius...

00:04:21.970 --> 00:04:25.223
However, though it might've
been an ironic twist of fate,

00:04:25.223 --> 00:04:28.143
one single love created a miracle.

00:04:30.687 --> 00:04:33.398
Believe it or not,

00:04:33.398 --> 00:04:39.070
Apollonius fell in love with Seliane,
a human woman--his enemy.

00:04:41.948 --> 00:04:43.116
That's...

00:04:43.116 --> 00:04:45.994
Mythic Aquarion...!

00:04:45.994 --> 00:04:51.416
The Mechanical Angel operated by
Apollonius drove the Shadow Angels away,

00:04:51.416 --> 00:04:54.919
and he protected Seliane
and mankind to the very end.

00:04:56.379 --> 00:05:00.258
However, along with this light,
darkness existed as well.

00:05:00.258 --> 00:05:04.095
The Shadow Angel Toma,
who was Apollonius' fiancé,

00:05:04.095 --> 00:05:09.517
came to hold feelings of both love and hatred
towards Apollonius, who betrayed him.

00:05:10.685 --> 00:05:13.229
And there was another being...

00:05:13.229 --> 00:05:17.067
A little one who was searching
for the light in the darkness.

00:05:17.067 --> 00:05:18.902
What's this dog?

00:05:18.902 --> 00:05:20.278
He's cute.

00:05:20.278 --> 00:05:25.825
It was the winged dog Pollon
who accompanied Apollonius.

00:05:25.825 --> 00:05:30.121
Of all things, he fell in love with Seliane,
the woman his owner loved,

00:05:30.121 --> 00:05:34.334
even though he knew this love
would not be reciprocated.

00:05:34.334 --> 00:05:38.713
Pitiful Pollon would wish to
the darkness in the night sky

00:05:38.713 --> 00:05:43.051
that he hoped to be joined together with
Seliane if he were able to be born again.

00:05:44.469 --> 00:05:47.514
Toma's hatred and Pollon's wish...

00:05:47.514 --> 00:05:53.061
Time cruelly pressed on,
leaving those feelings behind.

00:05:53.061 --> 00:05:56.981
The shadow of the dead...
The suffering of the living...

00:05:56.981 --> 00:06:00.652
The joy of the darkness...
The madness of the light...

00:06:00.652 --> 00:06:03.947
Let's put them all together.

00:06:03.947 --> 00:06:06.700
Let's wrap them up using a pretty lace.

00:06:08.034 --> 00:06:12.205
The light during the day is life.
The darkness at night is death.

00:06:12.205 --> 00:06:15.959
They chaotically blend together and...

00:06:17.711 --> 00:06:19.504
Pay close attention!

00:06:19.504 --> 00:06:22.465
The second chapter of the myth starts now!

00:06:27.345 --> 00:06:29.347
This image is...

00:06:29.347 --> 00:06:31.391
I've seen this same image before.

00:06:31.391 --> 00:06:33.476
A long time had passed.

00:06:33.476 --> 00:06:39.441
The revived Shadow Angels became a
great darkness that attacked mankind.

00:06:39.441 --> 00:06:45.238
However, people still remembered
the legend that told of their salvation.

00:06:46.698 --> 00:06:47.991
Supreme Commander?!

00:06:47.991 --> 00:06:50.785
Why is Supreme Commander Fudo here?

00:06:50.785 --> 00:06:53.663
This is an image from twelve
thousand years ago, right?

00:06:56.666 --> 00:06:58.543
Pay attention!

00:06:58.543 --> 00:07:01.171
We are in the midst of the myth!

00:07:07.177 --> 00:07:10.221
People fought back using
the ancient Mechanical Angel

00:07:10.221 --> 00:07:15.226
that they were able to excavate
using the legend to guide them.

00:07:15.226 --> 00:07:20.982
In that era, in place of Apollonius,
the one who operated Aquarion...

00:07:20.982 --> 00:07:23.151
...was a young man named Apollo.

00:07:23.151 --> 00:07:25.570
I see, that must be Apollonius'...

00:07:25.570 --> 00:07:27.238
...reincarnation!

00:07:27.238 --> 00:07:30.200
No, that's not the case.

00:07:30.200 --> 00:07:32.869
His original soul was...

00:07:40.001 --> 00:07:41.294
How dare you, Kagura?

00:07:41.294 --> 00:07:45.799
It's clearly an act of rebellion
to keep the true Eve to himself.

00:07:45.799 --> 00:07:50.178
You no longer have a place
to go back to on Altair!

00:07:53.640 --> 00:07:55.141
Dammit!

00:07:59.938 --> 00:08:03.274
I'm not gonna let anyone have Silffy!

00:08:03.274 --> 00:08:07.153
Forgive me, Apollon...

00:08:08.405 --> 00:08:13.993
That's right... Apollo was a
reincarnation of the winged dog Pollon.

00:08:13.993 --> 00:08:16.287
To think that the former life
of the Apollon from the legend

00:08:16.287 --> 00:08:18.123
was a winged dog...!

00:08:18.123 --> 00:08:24.629
And his loved one Seliane
was also reincarnated as Silvia.

00:08:24.629 --> 00:08:27.590
They had the strange fate to meet by chance

00:08:27.590 --> 00:08:31.636
and they became attracted to each
other while the battle was going on.

00:08:31.636 --> 00:08:35.432
However, fate is such a cruel thing.

00:08:37.308 --> 00:08:43.481
The Shadow Angel Toma, too,
was reincarnated into this era.

00:08:43.481 --> 00:08:47.360
Inheriting unaltered his
feelings of love and hatred,

00:08:47.360 --> 00:08:52.282
Toma planed to destroy the mankind
that Apollonius had protected.

00:08:52.282 --> 00:08:58.830
However, his distorted love ended up
destroying the Shadow Angels.

00:08:58.830 --> 00:09:03.251
The Tree of Life planted to achieve the
complete revival of the Shadow Angels

00:09:03.251 --> 00:09:09.007
died without bearing fruit,
dragging the earth of this planet with it.

00:09:11.843 --> 00:09:16.348
If all goes well, let's meet
again in another 12,000 years!

00:09:17.807 --> 00:09:19.392
Apollo!

00:09:19.392 --> 00:09:21.478
Let's go, friends.

00:09:21.478 --> 00:09:24.022
--For the sake of humans and Angels...
--And this planet...

00:09:24.022 --> 00:09:26.608
A new Genesis!

00:09:30.028 --> 00:09:34.199
Alas... poor winged dog Pollon...

00:09:34.199 --> 00:09:37.994
Without his wish from twelve
thousand years ago coming true,

00:09:37.994 --> 00:09:42.207
he ended up having to say
goodbye to her once again.

00:09:42.207 --> 00:09:46.044
It was the first day of the world.

00:09:57.764 --> 00:10:01.893
Another ten thousand years
and two thousand more passed,

00:10:01.893 --> 00:10:03.269
and the myth started the third chapter.

00:10:03.269 --> 00:10:04.938
Third chapter?

00:10:04.938 --> 00:10:06.147
Could it be...?

00:10:06.147 --> 00:10:09.526
That's right. It takes place...

00:10:09.526 --> 00:10:11.027
...in the present day.

00:10:21.037 --> 00:10:23.248
Earth is being split!

00:10:23.248 --> 00:10:28.044
When the Tree of Life died,
the world's balance was disrupted

00:10:28.044 --> 00:10:30.755
and Earth was split into two.

00:10:30.755 --> 00:10:35.176
Light and darkness.
Yin and yang. Man and woman.

00:10:35.176 --> 00:10:37.387
The two planets that run
counter to each other...

00:10:37.387 --> 00:10:43.852
They're Vega and Altair
separated by the Milky Way.

00:10:47.063 --> 00:10:48.481
In other words,

00:10:48.481 --> 00:10:53.194
they're our Earth and the other Earth
on the other side of the dimensional gate.

00:10:53.194 --> 00:10:55.613
Can't be! Our Earth...

00:10:55.613 --> 00:10:57.198
...and the world opposing us...

00:10:57.198 --> 00:10:59.951
...were originally one planet?

00:10:59.951 --> 00:11:02.537
It may have been the result of God rolling a die

00:11:02.537 --> 00:11:05.165
or an entanglement of quantum energy...

00:11:05.165 --> 00:11:10.128
Although they were separated, these two
worlds are attracted to each other.

00:11:10.128 --> 00:11:14.549
A planet that split into two...
A soul torn into two...

00:11:17.344 --> 00:11:17.802
"The Book of the Twin Stars"

00:11:17.802 --> 00:11:20.263
"The Book of the Twin Stars"
This is, indeed, the Book of the Twin Stars!

00:11:24.476 --> 00:11:27.187
Just like I desire Amata,

00:11:27.187 --> 00:11:31.149
the other world also desired our world.

00:11:31.149 --> 00:11:33.568
Planets that are attracted to each other...

00:11:35.111 --> 00:11:36.654
Shrade!

00:11:36.654 --> 00:11:38.281
I'm okay.

00:11:38.281 --> 00:11:41.076
Oddly enough, I feel good.

00:11:41.076 --> 00:11:46.790
I feel like I'll be able to find...
the final melody I've been searching for.

00:11:47.916 --> 00:11:51.961
The two melodies of the two
planets that desire each other...

00:11:51.961 --> 00:11:57.217
I bet they both get quite lonely... just like me.

00:11:57.217 --> 00:12:00.136
Lonely? You are?

00:12:00.136 --> 00:12:02.347
That's why I chased after it...

00:12:02.347 --> 00:12:06.142
In order to fill the gap in my chipped heart.

00:12:07.894 --> 00:12:10.897
Time passed, and after having
been reincarnated as Apollo,

00:12:10.897 --> 00:12:14.484
Pollon was once again reincarnated...

00:12:14.484 --> 00:12:18.947
...as a child of Alicia, a diva in the Vega world.

00:12:20.115 --> 00:12:21.574
However...

00:12:24.202 --> 00:12:28.707
...someone else was reincarnated
in the present day before him...

00:12:28.707 --> 00:12:32.669
...with all his memories from the past.

00:12:32.669 --> 00:12:35.714
--Donar!
--This pain... Don't tell me...

00:12:35.714 --> 00:12:39.634
Apollo is not Apollonius.

00:12:39.634 --> 00:12:43.138
He deceived me.

00:12:43.138 --> 00:12:45.682
I hate him.

00:12:45.682 --> 00:12:47.559
Revenge...

00:12:47.559 --> 00:12:50.603
That's right. I'll take revenge!

00:12:50.603 --> 00:12:54.566
He split the soul of the little child
Alicia gave birth to into two

00:12:54.566 --> 00:12:58.778
in order to use him as a
tool for his own revenge.

00:13:00.030 --> 00:13:02.449
Amata! Could that possibly be...?

00:13:03.867 --> 00:13:06.745
While Apollo was torn into two like this,

00:13:06.745 --> 00:13:10.373
Silvia, who inherited Seliane's love,

00:13:10.373 --> 00:13:14.044
was revived successfully in the
present day as a single person.

00:13:14.044 --> 00:13:16.379
Could that possibly be...?

00:13:16.379 --> 00:13:21.134
The one who truly inherited
Silvia's soul... That is...

00:13:27.599 --> 00:13:29.100
Mikono?!

00:13:29.100 --> 00:13:30.643
Mikono!

00:13:32.645 --> 00:13:34.147
Zessica?

00:13:37.692 --> 00:13:42.489
To think that Amata was
one half of Apollo's soul...

00:13:42.489 --> 00:13:46.534
After all, there was no room
for me to come between them.

00:13:47.827 --> 00:13:50.872
The battle between the two planets
that were originally one...

00:13:50.872 --> 00:13:54.751
And Apollo's life that was split into two...

00:13:54.751 --> 00:13:57.587
It's a myth of tragedy.

00:13:58.797 --> 00:14:03.134
The existence of darkness
that stages this tragedy...

00:14:03.134 --> 00:14:08.515
A soul obsessed with a love that ran too
deep for twenty-four thousand years...

00:14:08.515 --> 00:14:11.685
That is the darkness found in Toma.

00:14:11.685 --> 00:14:13.687
His name in this era is...

00:14:14.896 --> 00:14:16.856
...Mykage...

00:14:16.856 --> 00:14:20.402
And the one who will end
this myth of tragedy is...

00:14:20.402 --> 00:14:22.278
...no one else but you guys!

00:14:23.863 --> 00:14:27.951
That's everything that I can
tell you about this story.

00:14:27.951 --> 00:14:29.536
Please wait!

00:14:29.536 --> 00:14:33.123
Isn't there anything written in the Book
of the Twin Stars after that point?!

00:14:33.123 --> 00:14:37.002
What about the end of this battle,
which my Prediction can't even foresee?!

00:14:38.253 --> 00:14:39.796
Take a look.

00:14:44.926 --> 00:14:47.804
--What?!
--This is...

00:14:47.804 --> 00:14:49.806
Blank pages?!

00:14:49.806 --> 00:14:54.853
You will write the pages from here on!

00:15:18.251 --> 00:15:19.794
You are...

00:15:19.794 --> 00:15:24.174
You're finally up! I wondered
what happened to you.

00:15:25.884 --> 00:15:29.054
What? Does it hurt somewhere?

00:15:29.054 --> 00:15:30.180
No...

00:15:30.180 --> 00:15:32.223
Then why are you crying?

00:15:33.975 --> 00:15:37.687
Because I can finally apologize to you.

00:15:39.564 --> 00:15:41.566
All this time...

00:15:41.566 --> 00:15:46.613
...I wasn't able to notice
your feelings... I'm sorry.

00:15:52.535 --> 00:15:55.246
I finally found it...

00:16:00.085 --> 00:16:03.421
I really took the roundabout
path to find it, didn't I...?

00:16:03.421 --> 00:16:06.257
The musical scales of the two
planets overlap each other

00:16:06.257 --> 00:16:09.010
and become pure white light.

00:16:09.010 --> 00:16:12.806
It's the empty space in my heart...

00:16:12.806 --> 00:16:15.767
...or perhaps a new world...!

00:16:15.767 --> 00:16:19.646
As if a pure white staff notation...!

00:16:25.902 --> 00:16:27.404
Listen to this.

00:16:34.411 --> 00:16:35.453
Shrade!

00:16:35.453 --> 00:16:37.038
This melody is...

00:16:43.086 --> 00:16:46.589
This is the final melody that I discovered.

00:16:46.589 --> 00:16:50.468
It's Aquarion's true music
created from nothingness!

00:16:50.468 --> 00:16:54.472
That's right... It's the opus
of the beginning of all things!

00:17:03.481 --> 00:17:07.360
Life is a rhythm.

00:17:07.360 --> 00:17:10.947
I'll play the rhythm of my life...

00:17:10.947 --> 00:17:14.117
...and create the path for you to move forward!

00:17:22.876 --> 00:17:27.839
In the past, I never even dreamed...

00:17:27.839 --> 00:17:31.926
...of playing the rhythm
of my life for someone...

00:17:34.346 --> 00:17:35.847
Shrade!

00:18:13.718 --> 00:18:15.679
Shrade!

00:18:22.686 --> 00:18:27.440
Did the melody of my heart... reach you?

00:18:42.539 --> 00:18:44.207
What's the matter, Cayenne?

00:18:45.458 --> 00:18:46.793
Nothing...

00:18:46.793 --> 00:18:49.504
It's strange.

00:18:49.504 --> 00:18:54.259
I think I know how you're feeling right now.

00:18:56.928 --> 00:19:00.432
The myth is written with the shed blood.

00:19:00.432 --> 00:19:01.850
Don't tell me...!

00:19:01.850 --> 00:19:06.479
A myth for the future has just been added.

00:19:21.286 --> 00:19:24.247
Amata! Where are you, Amata?!

00:19:25.957 --> 00:19:27.667
Amata!

00:19:28.877 --> 00:19:32.464
I've been waiting... for this moment.

00:19:35.133 --> 00:19:37.135
Y... You...!

00:19:46.644 --> 00:19:49.606
That's right. Good girl.

00:20:07.123 --> 00:20:13.338
Oh... How wonderful to have a real body!

00:20:13.338 --> 00:20:16.341
No! That's not my voice!

00:20:16.341 --> 00:20:18.510
Don't tell me you took over my body!

00:20:18.510 --> 00:20:22.180
You are a vessel with a wonderful body.

00:20:22.180 --> 00:20:26.184
Now I can finally fulfill my long-awaited dream.

00:20:27.268 --> 00:20:29.270
Give me my body back!

00:20:29.270 --> 00:20:31.940
A promise is something you must keep, right?

00:20:33.358 --> 00:20:34.943
You are...!

00:20:34.943 --> 00:20:41.366
My name is Mykage.
I live in the shadow of love.

00:20:41.366 --> 00:20:43.451
You should appreciate me.

00:20:43.451 --> 00:20:48.123
It's rare that a wingless one
has an angel dwell inside them.

00:20:57.757 --> 00:20:59.259
Reverse!

00:21:04.055 --> 00:21:07.392
Kagura! There's no longer
a place for you to run to.

00:21:07.392 --> 00:21:10.770
Stop fighting and hand over the true Eve to us!

00:21:10.770 --> 00:21:13.648
Dammit! That damn Izumo!

00:21:13.648 --> 00:21:15.984
I'm not gonna let anyone have my damn woman!

00:21:15.984 --> 00:21:18.319
She is the damn woman for me alone!

00:21:18.319 --> 00:21:19.904
Mikono!

00:21:21.573 --> 00:21:22.949
Zessica!

00:21:22.949 --> 00:21:25.285
I've realized...

00:21:25.285 --> 00:21:28.580
...that the leader of their planet is out
of control, and unless we bring him down,

00:21:28.580 --> 00:21:30.331
this battle won't end!

00:21:30.331 --> 00:21:31.374
Zessica?

00:21:31.374 --> 00:21:36.129
So... call Solar Wing... Solar Aquarion!

00:21:36.129 --> 00:21:38.089
Me?

00:21:38.089 --> 00:21:42.344
You inherited Apollo's soul.
I'm sure you can do it!

00:21:42.344 --> 00:21:44.554
Right... You can do it.

00:21:48.308 --> 00:21:52.937
Aquarion!

00:22:07.702 --> 00:22:09.579
It really came!

00:22:33.895 --> 00:22:36.690
Solar Wing...?!

00:22:36.690 --> 00:22:39.484
So you stand in my way?!

00:22:42.987 --> 00:22:44.989
Well, then...

00:22:44.989 --> 00:22:50.745
Why don't I begin telling... the real myth?

00:22:52.706 --> 00:22:58.378
<i>Due to the kindness that doesn't know conflict</i>

00:22:58.378 --> 00:23:01.214
<i>The two get lost in the foggy forest</i>

00:23:01.214 --> 00:23:08.888
<i>and end up a thousand years apart</i>

00:23:08.888 --> 00:23:11.141
<i>An ashen harmony...</i>

00:23:11.141 --> 00:23:16.354
<i>Why can't love and freedom find each other?</i>

00:23:16.354 --> 00:23:21.943
<i>until they become dewdrops</i>
<i>in the wilderness one day</i>

00:23:21.943 --> 00:23:26.614
<i>The weight of the soul... The weight of love...</i>

00:23:26.614 --> 00:23:29.367
<i>I was listening to them with my entire body</i>

00:23:29.367 --> 00:23:36.082
<i>You look sorrowful and noble from behind</i>

00:23:36.082 --> 00:23:43.757
<i>If I could protect your dream all the way...</i>

00:23:43.757 --> 00:23:50.305
<i>A long flare that struggles against the moon</i>

00:23:50.305 --> 00:23:56.770
<i>A story that ends even before it begins</i>

00:23:56.770 --> 00:24:02.776
<i>The tears I softly put in the sky</i>
<i>are an unfinished sinfonia</i>

00:24:02.776 --> 00:24:04.027
<i>Just for you...</i>

00:24:04.027 --> 00:24:05.862
<i>Just for you...</i>

00:24:05.862 --> 00:24:12.369
<i>The will of the stars...</i>

00:24:12.369 --> 00:24:18.583
<i>I want to see you</i>

00:24:23.213 --> 00:24:28.301
When I close my eyes, I can always
go back to that calm morning.

00:24:28.301 --> 00:24:32.263
But even so, I must open my eyes...

00:24:33.932 --> 00:24:37.163
"Next Episode 'ephemera'"
...and I'll hold the life running amok in my arms.
